[32m+[m[32m## Milestone 7: Native Short-Term Memory[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mObjective: add lightweight multi-turn memory using LangChain/LangGraph's native checkpointer-based thread memory.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWhat to implement:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- native short-term memory through a shared checkpointer[m
[32m+[m[32m- `InMemorySaver` for MVP[m
[32m+[m[32m- `session_id` mapped to `thread_id`[m
[32m+[m[32m- memory automatically read and updated by the runtime on each invocation[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mConstraints:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- memory is session-scoped only[m
[32m+[m[32m- memory is in-process only for MVP[m
[32m+[m[32m- memory resets on app restart[m
[32m+[m[32m- no long-term or cross-session recall[m
[32m+[m[32m- no custom manual transcript store in the service layer[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSuccess criteria:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- follow-up questions work inside the same `session_id`[m
[32m+[m[32m- separate sessions stay isolated[m
[32m+[m[32m- the app still works when `session_id` is missing[m
[32m+[m[32m- memory implementation remains invisible to the route layer[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMemory note:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse native checkpointer-based short-term memory before building any custom memory layer. If context growth later hurts latency or model quality, the next optimization should be message trimming, not long-term memory.[m
